    {
      "id": "blk_7620c07d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "海蚀现象下，由残存混乱的频率能量构成的类生命体，外形不定，具备特殊结构“声核”，学界也称其为「残响体」。﻿",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1026a303",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "﻿残象的本能是通过吞噬融合其他频率以维系自身稳定乃至进化，行为模式类似捕食。﻿",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b3724dfe",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "﻿其能力、外形和行为因频率信息构成差异而有所不同，多为拟态。﻿",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
